.0},{"id":"1267175202892414976","date":1590953086000,"rawContent":"Loving the chants of \"This is what solidarity looks like\" &amp; more -- from the giant, peaceful, multi-racial &amp; multi-generational march staged by recent high school grads in Evanston IL. Just a deeply moving, determined, and hopeful scene. #GeorgeFloydProtests #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/RCl6O7HIqd","userId":7884802,"media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video_thumb\/1267175166053842954\/pu\/img\/fOIET42IcIzXvj4P.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1267175166053842954\/pu\/vid\/480x270\/UsMo2dXcttGxH5XR.mp4?tag=10","https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1267175166053842954\/pu\/vid\/1280x720\/wUMszRPSVmDoxjMG.mp4?tag=10","https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1267175166053842954\/pu\/pl\/HX2hqANVWNjgZYbq.m3u8?tag=10","https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1267175166053842954\/pu\/vid\/640x360\/T0sU-znkEDJBc_9e.mp4?tag=10"]}],"username":"annagalland","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1268298776340500481","date":1591220966000,"rawContent":"Scanning the heap of #BlackLivesMatter statements in my inbox, seems like the bar should be higher. Maybe companies feel like any written statement is a big step, but c'mon, even George W. Bush did that. Are you moving $ to bail funds? Amplifying specific @Mvmnt4BlkLives demands?","userId":7884802,"media":null,"username":"annagalland","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1268907196684931072","date":1591366025000,"rawContent":"So much is possible. A transformation of culture, laws, &amp; practices to live into #BlackLivesMatter vision. Realizing the dream of a true democracy. Building a just, sustainable economy where all families can live with dignity.\n\nNot inevitable; possible, &amp; only if we keep pushing.","userId":7884802,"media":null,"username":"annagalland","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1269797330682707970","date":1591578249000,"rawContent":"Sunday mood: Still-fresh grief &amp; fury over so much preventable death &amp; loss &amp; economic ruin from COVID-19. Fear &amp; anger at police riots &amp; Trump's fascist displays. But then also: an electric wave of energy, awe, &amp; hope from the massive, transformative #BlackLivesMatter uprising.","userId":7884802,"media":null,"username":"annagalland","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1269966390821376000","date":1591618557000,"rawContent":"A partial, ever-growing list of concrete policy changes catalyzed by this historic #BlackLivesMatter uprising, building on years of patient organizing.\n\n(Via @IanSams. Crowdsourced &amp; compiled by Fahd Ahmed of @DesisRisingUp. Full running list: https:\/\/t.co\/pNkvrftN6e) https:\/\/t.co\/goOkXv8IxB","userId":7884802,"media":["https:\/\/p