y -- painting the street, handing out flyers, even in today's 90 degree heat. Alongside &amp; after the giant #blacklivesmatter marches, there are tenacious groups digging in for the long haul. https:\/\/t.co\/A6xmi7ljAM","userId":7884802,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EcMEMk0XsAA4pXF?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"annagalland","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":15,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]